source: crates/standalone/fixture/src/lib.rs
---
Print the manual page.

Usage: ink man

Examples
  ink man  # The manual page as roff, to save as ink.1

Exit codes
  0  Done; warnings, if any, were printed
  1  The site has errors
  2  Wrong usage, or a folder that is missing; nothing was changed

Docs    https://github.com/uses-ink/uses.ink/blob/main/docs/cli.md
Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
